a</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Physical exercise reduces risk of breast cancer in Japanese women</article-title><source>Cancer Sci</source><year>2003</year><volume>94</volume><fpage>193</fpage><lpage>199</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Sci||94|193||bib10|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12708496</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>IARC</collab></person-group><article-title/><source>IARC Handbooks of Cancer Prevention, Vol 6: Weight Control and Physical Activity</source><year>2002</year><publisher-name>Lyon: International Agency for Research on Cancer</publisher-name><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>315</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>John</surname><given-names>EM</given-names></name><name><surname>Horn-Ross</surname><given-names>PL</given-names></name><name><surname>Koo</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Lifetime physical activity and breast cancer risk in a multiethnic population: the San Francisco Bay area breast cancer study</article-title><source>Cancer Epidemiol Biomarkers Prev</source><year>2003</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>1143</fpage><lpage>1152</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Epidemiol Biomarkers Prev||12|1143||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14652273</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lagerros</surname><given-names>YT</given-names></name><name><surname>Hsieh</surname><given-names>SF</given-names></name><name><surname>Hsieh</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Physical activity in adolescence and young adulthood and breast cancer risk: a quantitative review</article-title><source>Eur J Cancer Prev</source><year>2004</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>